Article 14
(1) Assistance encompasses all integrated efforts to restore and strengthen the condition of victims carried out by the Police, Prosecutor's Office, Courts, Advocates and social workers, Women's Crisis Center, women's organizations and social organizations concerned with women and children;
(2) Assistance by the police, prosecutor's office, courts, and advocates as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be in accordance with laws and regulations.

